A demolishing strike that deals $947486s3% weapon damage plus $s2 and demolishes the target's defenses, increasing the physical damage they take from your attacks by $954092s1%. Each time the target is critically hit in melee their defenses are further demolished, up to a maximum of $954092u stacks.

@ext:Demolishing Strike scales with modifiers to Mortal Strikes but does not work with Single-Minded Fury.:ext@
